      "worked": "The total of the five numbers is $5\\times2=10$. After deleting one number, four numbers remain, with total $4\\times4=16$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Smallest number}&=10-16\\\\\\text{Smallest number}&=-6\\end{align*}$$",
